# Logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*

# Document Processing & Data
backend/data/documents/*
!backend/data/documents/.gitkeep
backend/data/processed/*
!backend/data/processed/.gitkeep

# Agent rules
frontend/AGENTS.md
frontend/CLAUDE.md
